      "id": "uixutils.dom",
      "name": "@ultimate/uix-utils DOM utilities",
      "framework": "shared",
      "purpose": "DOM and browser utilities exported through the UIX utility package root and DOM subpath.",
      "surface": "The DOM barrel exposes 84 method defaults and five helper defaults as named exports; the ConnectedOverlayScrollHandler helper is a class, the others are functions. [The authored README](README.md) lists each call signature, source path, purpose, and observed runtime boundary. The source files do not access DOM/browser globals during module initialization; functions may access them when invoked, so this does not establish blanket SSR safety. Helper option interfaces are exported only from helper modules and omitted from the barrel; BrowserType is local to getBrowser.ts.",
